{"id": "99210119", "name": "משולש עם נקודות נורמליות על הצירים – E|P| ותוחלת השטח", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>מגרילים נקודה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\((P,0)\\)</span> על ציר ה-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span> ונקודה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\((0,Q)\\)</span> על ציר ה-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y\\)</span>, כאשר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P\\sim N(0,{{CT:0}})\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Q\\sim N(0,{{CT:1}})\\)</span> בלתי תלויים (הפרמטר השני הוא השונות). שתי הנקודות יוצרות משולש ישר-זווית עם ראשית הצירים.</p><p style=\"margin-top:12px\">א. חשבו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{E}[|P|]\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p class=\"input-hint\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">את \\(\\pi\\) מזינים <code dir=\"ltr\">pi</code>, ואת השורש <code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(...)</code>. למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(2/pi)</code>.</p><p style=\"margin-top:12px\">ב. חשבו את תוחלת שטח המשולש.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> השטח הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\frac{|P|\\,|Q|}{2}\\)</span>; תוחלת של מכפלת משתנים בלתי תלויים היא מכפלת התוחלות.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — E|Z| לנורמלית סטנדרטית</b><br>אם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Z\\sim N(0,1)\\)</span>, אז<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{E}[|Z|]=2\\int_0^\\infty \\frac{t}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}}e^{-t^2/2}dt=\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}}\\left[-e^{-t^2/2}\\right]_0^\\infty=\\sqrt{\\frac2\\pi} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — E|P|</b><br><span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P={{CT:2}}Z\\)</span> (סטיית התקן היא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\sqrt{ {{CT:0}} }={{CT:2}}\\)</span>), ולכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{E}[|P|]={{CT:2}}\\sqrt{\\frac2\\pi}={{CT:3}} \\]</p>ובאותו אופן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{E}[|Q|]={{CT:4}}\\sqrt{\\frac2\\pi}\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — תוחלת השטח</b><br>מאי-התלות:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{E}\\left[\\frac{|P|\\,|Q|}{2}\\right]=\\frac12\\mathbb{E}[|P|]\\,\\mathbb{E}[|Q|]=\\frac12\\cdot{{CT:5}}\\cdot\\frac{2}{\\pi}={{CT:6}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]][[feedback:prt2]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 40, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "t1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "t2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "0", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-2-T", "feedback": "<p>השטח הוא \\(|P|\\,|Q|/2\\) (עם ערך מוחלט), ולכן התוחלת חיובית. \\(\\mathbb{E}[P]\\mathbb{E}[Q]=0\\) אינו רלוונטי כאן.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-2-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["s1", "s2", "t1", "t2", "v1", "v2"], "nvariants": 16}